From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] kernelbase: Use in-process GPU for Zenless Zone Zero launcher

Zenless Zone Zero's HYP launcher can hit Wine-Wayland GPU-process issues in
its embedded Chromium UI. Run its GPU process in-process, matching the
existing launcher workarounds.
---
 dlls/kernelbase/process.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/dlls/kernelbase/process.c b/dlls/kernelbase/process.c
index aaaaaaaaaaa..bbbbbbbbbbb 100644
--- a/dlls/kernelbase/process.c
+++ b/dlls/kernelbase/process.c
@@ -616,6 +616,7 @@ static const WCHAR *hack_append_command_line( const WCHAR *cmd )
         {L"Warhammer2.exe", L" --in-process-gpu"},
         {L"SummerIslands.exe", L" --in-process-gpu"},
         {L"Battle.net Launcher.exe", L" --in-process-gpu"},
+        {L"Zenless Zone Zero\\HYP.exe", L" --in-process-gpu"},
         {L"Warframe\\Tools\\Launcher.exe", L" --in-process-gpu"},
         {L"Paradox Launcher.exe", L" --use-angle=gl"},
         {L"Montaro\\nw.exe", L" --use-gl=swiftshader"},
-- 
2.54.0
